#. ja: ダルメルを観察しろ！
#. de: Beobachte den Dhalmel!
#. fr: Mission d'observation
#. column 11: ev_snipe_clic0f
#. column 94: Creation of the perfect stuffed dhalmel<br>begins with observation of a live<br>specimen. Inspect the beast thoroughly.
#. column 96: Look over every ilm of the dhalmel
#. column 104: Observe
msgctxt "Snipe:4:0:93"
msgid "Size Up the Dhalmel!"
msgstr "Осмотри далмеля!"

#. ja: いい剥製を造るには<br>生きたダルメルの観察が必須<br>ダルメルの全身をくまなく見ろ
#. de: Die Beobachtung am lebenden<br>Objekt ist für die Herstellung<br>eines Tierpräparats unverzichtbar.<br>Sieh dir den Dhalmel von<br>Kopf bis Fuß gründlich an,<br>um dir seine anatomischen Details einzuprägen.
#. fr: Pour réaliser des pièces de taxidermie parfaites, il est nécessaire d'observer les animaux évoluer dans leur habitat naturel.<br>Trouvez un grand dhalmel et examinez-le at<shy>ten<shy>ti<shy>ve<shy>ment.
#. column 11: ev_snipe_clic0f
#. column 93: Size Up the Dhalmel!
#. column 96: Look over every ilm of the dhalmel
#. column 104: Observe
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "Snipe:4:0:94"
msgid "Creation of the perfect stuffed dhalmel<br>begins with observation of a live<br>specimen. Inspect the beast thoroughly."
msgstr "Чтобы сделать чучело далмеля, сначала нужно понаблюдать за живым зверем.<br>Осмотри его как следует."

#. ja: 大きなダルメルの全身を観察する
#. de: Den großen Dhalmel von Kopf bis Fuß betrachten
#. fr: Observer un grand dhalmel
#. column 11: ev_snipe_clic0f
#. column 93: Size Up the Dhalmel!
#. column 94: Creation of the perfect stuffed dhalmel<br>begins with observation of a live<br>specimen. Inspect the beast thoroughly.
#. column 104: Observe
msgctxt "Snipe:4:0:96"
msgid "Look over every ilm of the dhalmel"
msgstr "Осмотри далмеля с ног до головы"

#. ja: 観察する
#. de: Beobachten
#. fr: Observer
#. column 11: ev_snipe_clic0f
#. column 93: Size Up the Dhalmel!
#. column 94: Creation of the perfect stuffed dhalmel<br>begins with observation of a live<br>specimen. Inspect the beast thoroughly.
#. column 96: Look over every ilm of the dhalmel
msgctxt "Snipe:4:0:104"
msgid "Observe"
msgstr "Наблюдать"

#. ja: 全ての的に吹き矢を当てろ！
#. de: Triff alle Ziele!
#. fr: Démonstration de précision
#. column 11: ev_snipe0cf
#. column 12: ev_snipe_hit0f
#. column 13: ev_snipe_mis0f
#. column 94: Determine the blowgun's effectiveness<br>by hitting all the targets.
#. column 96: Hit the specified targets
#. column 104: Blow
msgctxt "Snipe:5:0:93"
msgid "Hit All the Targets!"
msgstr "Попади во все мишени!"

#. ja: 吹き矢の有用性を示すため、<br>全ての的に吹き矢を当てろ！
#. de: Ermittle die Effektivität des<br>Blasrohrs, indem du versuchst,<br>alle Ziele zu treffen.
#. fr: Le cantinier loyal a préparé des cibles pour prouver aux Mhigois que les sarbacanes peuvent être très efficaces.
#. column 11: ev_snipe0cf
#. column 12: ev_snipe_hit0f
#. column 13: ev_snipe_mis0f
#. column 93: Hit All the Targets!
#. column 96: Hit the specified targets
#. column 104: Blow
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "Snipe:5:0:94"
msgid "Determine the blowgun's effectiveness<br>by hitting all the targets."
msgstr "Проверь, насколько эффективно духовое ружьё:<br>попади во все мишени."

#. ja: 指定された的に吹き矢を当てる
#. de: Die Zielscheiben treffen
#. fr: Toucher une fois chaque cible
#. column 11: ev_snipe0cf
#. column 12: ev_snipe_hit0f
#. column 13: ev_snipe_mis0f
#. column 93: Hit All the Targets!
#. column 94: Determine the blowgun's effectiveness<br>by hitting all the targets.
#. column 104: Blow
msgctxt "Snipe:5:0:96"
msgid "Hit the specified targets"
msgstr "Попади в указанные мишени"

#. ja: 吹き矢を放つ
#. de: Betäubungspfeil verschießen
#. fr: Tirer avec la sarbacane
#. column 11: ev_snipe0cf
#. column 12: ev_snipe_hit0f
#. column 13: ev_snipe_mis0f
#. column 93: Hit All the Targets!
#. column 94: Determine the blowgun's effectiveness<br>by hitting all the targets.
#. column 96: Hit the specified targets
msgctxt "Snipe:5:0:104"
msgid "Blow"
msgstr "Выстрелить"

#. ja: 浜の行き倒れを確認しろ！
#. de: Suche den Strand ab!
#. fr: Réalité ou hallucination ?
#. column 11: ev_snipe_clic0f
#. column 94: Reports state someone has collapsed<br>on shore. Search the area and confirm<br>the account.
#. column 96: Find the collapsed individual
#. column 104: Confirm
msgctxt "Snipe:6:0:93"
msgid "Search the Shore!"
msgstr "Обыщи берег!"

#. ja: 浜辺に人が倒れているらしい<br>行き倒れている人を探し、確認せよ
#. de: Der Späher hat dir erzählt,<br>dass jemand reglos am Strand<br>liegt. Sieh nach, ob du diese<br>Behauptung bestätigen kannst.
#. fr: Une personne aurait été découverte in<shy>cons<shy>cien<shy>te sur la plage.<br>Inspectez la zone et assurez-vous que le pirate ne souffre pas d'hallucinations.
#. column 11: ev_snipe_clic0f
#. column 93: Search the Shore!
#. column 96: Find the collapsed individual
#. column 104: Confirm
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "Snipe:6:0:94"
msgid "Reports state someone has collapsed<br>on shore. Search the area and confirm<br>the account."
msgstr "Говорят, на берегу кто-то упал без сил.<br>Обыщи местность и проверь, так ли это."

#. ja: 行き倒れている人を確認する
#. de: Die reglose Person am Strand finden
#. fr: Vérifier s'il y a une personne in<shy>cons<shy>cien<shy>te sur la plage
#. column 11: ev_snipe_clic0f
#. column 93: Search the Shore!
#. column 94: Reports state someone has collapsed<br>on shore. Search the area and confirm<br>the account.
#. column 104: Confirm
msgctxt "Snipe:6:0:96"
msgid "Find the collapsed individual"
msgstr "Найди упавшего человека"

#. ja: 確認する
#. de: Bestätigen
#. fr: Vérifier
#. column 11: ev_snipe_clic0f
#. column 93: Search the Shore!
#. column 94: Reports state someone has collapsed<br>on shore. Search the area and confirm<br>the account.
#. column 96: Find the collapsed individual
msgctxt "Snipe:6:0:104"
